{"1540130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vaccine Delivery Simulator", "steam_appid": 1540130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<strong>Vaccine Delivery Simulator</strong> is a fun challenging game. You must manage to deliver the vaccine to the infected. Your accuracy is important! Most of the game, you'll be throwing the vaccine<br><br>A virus has invaded the world and it is you who must help defeat it!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1540130/extras/a7fab8fc5b5e29cc2d820369a957b8a0.avif?t=1728887443\" width=300 height=100 /></span><br><br>You <strong>Bogdan Kowalski</strong> are a courier and a brave altruist.<br><br>Your partner <strong>Carl</strong> - the helicopter pilot, takes you to the platforms. After disembarking, you need to find the infected person and <strong>have time</strong> to deliver the vaccine as soon as possible.<br><br>You will be delivering the vaccine <strong>in different ways</strong>, but most of the game you will <strong>throw</strong> the vaccine, so your <strong>accuracy</strong> is important!<br><br>Each platform is unique, <strong>use the environment</strong> to your advantage!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1540130/extras/54a9c1d73449662bf5ab5b4409fa87a0.avif?t=1728887443\" width=300 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> fun<br></li><li> different modes<br></li><li> dozens of unique levels<br></li><li> many game mechanics<br></li><li> bosses<br></li><li> cutscenes<br></li><li> secret badges scattered across the level<br></li><li> musical instrument &quot;BIBAS-ATAS&quot;<br></li><li> beautiful graphics<br></li><li> amazing music in SCI-FI style</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<strong>Vaccine Delivery Simulator</strong> is a fun challenging game. You